###-------------------------###
### Health check
###-------------------------###
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###-------------------------###
### REGISTER ###
###-------------------------###

### Register user 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Register user 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vkuryndin@gmail.com",
  "username": "volodya",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Register duplicate email or username
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser_duplicate",
  "password": "password123"
}

