Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Predict balance user 1 365 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/predict?days=365
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Predict balance user 1 invalid days
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId1user1}}/predict?days=366
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

